| Metric                | scikit-learn | TensorFlow                                   | PyTorch                           |
| --------------------- | ------------ | -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |
| Accuracy              | ✅            | ✅                                            | Via TorchMetrics or `sklearn`     |
| Precision             | ✅            | ✅                                            | Via TorchMetrics or `sklearn`     |
| Recall                | ✅            | ✅                                            | Via TorchMetrics or `sklearn`     |
| F1 Score              | ✅            | Possible as a metric (or external libraries) | Via TorchMetrics or `sklearn`     |
| Confusion Matrix      | ✅            | ✅ (`tf.math.confusion_matrix`)               | Usually `sklearn` or TorchMetrics |
| Classification Report | ✅            | ❌                                            | ❌                                 |
| ROC Curve             | ✅            | Partial support                              | Usually `sklearn` or TorchMetrics |
| AUC                   | ✅            | ✅                                            | Via TorchMetrics or `sklearn`     |
